        "login": "sabrinatoro"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "@mtwilke-art \nI am working on your request, and i have a question about \"UROS-related erythropoietic porphyria\". \nThe suggested definition is \"An erythropoietic porphyria caused by biallelic variants in UROS (in an autosomal recessive inheritance pattern). (...)\". \nWe do not currently have the term \"erythropoietic porphyria\" in Mondo. Is it the same as 'erythropoietic protoporphyria'? If not, could you please share a definition for \"erythropoietic porphyria\" ? Is this a term that we need to create? \n\nThank you! ",
